  "details": "After this new update, pasting links into video players or really anything in general isn't working as intended. \n\nWhen clicking a video player's link box, the \"Enter URL\" prompt comes up as it should. But when you do CTRL + V on your keyboard, the link doesn't paste into the URL box popup, but the video player URL box instead. Hitting enter doesn't work on the popup URL box either when this happens.\n\nSee below for example.\n\nEdit: Seems like the issue is less likely to happen in VR?",
